{"id":"0faa654605ca7e90","group":"90","path":"90/90-lem-parameterized-recursion.md","title":"Uniform Parameterized Recursion","display":"lem-parameterized-recursion — Uniform Parameterized Recursion","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-lem-parameterized-recursion","aliases":["90-lem-parameterized-recursion"],"display":"lem-parameterized-recursion — Uniform Parameterized Recursion","depends_on":["[[90-df-program-numbering]]","[[90-lem-program-numbering]]","[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]","[[88-thm-smn]]","[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-lem-parameterized-recursion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-lem-parameterized-recursion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-parameterized-recursion — Uniform Parameterized Recursion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"eb17d82fac64b1a6\" href=\"?note=eb17d82fac64b1a6\" title=\"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">88-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2e54d7c09866228f\" href=\"?note=2e54d7c09866228f\" title=\"88-thm-smn\">88-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定编号族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\ge1}\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\ge1}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}\">\\(\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}\\)</span> 及部分函数等号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq\">\\(\\simeq\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a>。</li>\n<li>要求 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"eb17d82fac64b1a6\" href=\"?note=eb17d82fac64b1a6\" title=\"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">88-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\)</span>；本书的具体编号满足该条件，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}_k,\\mathrm{PartRec}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}_k,\\mathrm{PartRec}_k\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ge1\">\\(k\\ge1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\">\\(\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>。本引理不更改任何原固定点接口，仅给后续多一归约提供统一索引。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_{k+2}\\ \\exists r\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_k\\\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ \\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\varphi_{r(\\vec n)}(x)\\simeq F(r(\\vec n),\\vec n,x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_{k+2}\\ \\exists r\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_k\\\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ \\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\varphi_{r(\\vec n)}(x)\\simeq F(r(\\vec n),\\vec n,x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"2e54d7c09866228f\" href=\"?note=2e54d7c09866228f\" title=\"88-thm-smn\">88-thm-smn</a> 取全递归 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(z,\\vec n)\">\\(q(z,\\vec n)\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{q(z,\\vec n)}(x)\\simeq\\varphi_z^{(k+2)}(z,\\vec n,x)\">\\(\\varphi_{q(z,\\vec n)}(x)\\simeq\\varphi_z^{(k+2)}(z,\\vec n,x)\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H(z,\\vec n,x)\\simeq F(q(z,\\vec n),\\vec n,x)\">\\(H(z,\\vec n,x)\\simeq F(q(z,\\vec n),\\vec n,x)\\)</span>，它是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(k+2)\">\\((k+2)\\)</span> 元部分递归函数，取其索引 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>。置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r(\\vec n)=q(a,\\vec n)\">\\(r(\\vec n)=q(a,\\vec n)\\)</span> 即得结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>结论是全递归地取得每组参数的固定点，而不是对每个参数分别存在一个索引。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-lem-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"42029390ebbb59c5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-lem-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering","